        "mode": "tldr",
        "content": "Append-only log of TSLA direction flips and key level breaks. One bullet per material event.\n\n---\n\n- **2026-05-01 | run 20260501_160246 | Setup type change: confirmed downtrend \u2192 trend-transition zone.** Prior setup (ADX 29.5, bearish EMA alignment, bear-rally short at $387\u2013$399 zone) retired. Post-earnings Fib bounce on Apr 30 (daily close $381.63 at 38.2% Fib $381.76 = strong confluence, 14-test support at $381.40). May 1 intraday surge +3.8% on 2.74x volume fired hourly squeeze; price entered $387\u2013$399 resistance zone. Decision: HOLD (35 conf). R/R fails 2:1 at all entries. Watch zone: $381\u2013$385 pullback with bullish daily candle \u2192 $409 target, $365 stop, 2.7:1. [source: runs/20260501_160246/decisions.json, signals_combined.json]\n\n- **2026-05-01 | run 20260501_160246 | Thesis flip trigger met.** Q1 2026 gross margin 18.03% crossed the 18%+ threshold that the bootstrap thesis (2026-04-29) listed as the bull-flip condition. Prior \"un-tradeable pending earnings\" stance retired. [source: web_research/TSLA.json \u2014 CNBC Apr 22 2026]",
